•	Why did I choose this beat? 
I chose AI in Fashion Marketing & E-commerce because I have always been interested in both fashion and marketing. I am currently studying Leisure & Event Management, where I learn a lot about marketing, communication and creating experiences for different target groups. I find it interesting to see how these skills can also be used in the fashion industry. AI is becoming more important in online fashion, for example through personalized recommendations, social media content, product descriptions and virtual try-ons. By choosing this beat, I can combine my personal interest in fashion with my interest in marketing and learn more about how AI is changing this industry.

